erarchy%20of%20importance%3F%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhat%20if%20we%20just%20had%20the%20party%20here%3F%26quot%3B%20I%20asked%20my%20husband%20one%20night%2C%20feeling%20exhausted%20and%20overwhelmed.%20We%20knew%20the%20risk%20of%20a%20house%20party%20in%20early%20March%20in%20St.%20Louis.%20If%20the%20weather%20were%20great%2C%20it%20would%20be%20easy.%20But%20if%20the%20weather%20did%20not%20work%20out%20in%20our%20favor%2C%20our%20home%20was%20not%20ideal.%20We%20have%20a%20two-story%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthree-bedroom-homes-us-cities-costs-quiz-2021-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ethree-bedroom%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20our%20rooms%20are%20by%20no%20means%20large.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20sawed%20back%20and%20forth%20for%20a%20while%20until%20I%20reminded%20my%20husband%20of%20the%20motto%20that%20has%20carried%20us%20through%20our%20crazier%20ideas%2C%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Funexpected-pregnancy-reshaped-van-life-tiny-house-journey-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eliving%20in%20a%20van%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fliving-off-grid-vs-van-life-pros-cons-benefits-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emoving%20completely%20off-grid%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20a%20state%20we%20barely%20knew%20years%20prior%3A%20%26quot%3BWe'll%20figure%20it%20out.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222d221d9f-4c78-493b-9954-4fa969fa558f%5C%22%3EWe%20leaned%20into%20the%20mess%20instead%20of%20fighting%20it%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20told%20our%20son%20he%20could%20invite%20any%20friends%20he%20wanted%20to%20his%20party.%20What%20we%20didn't%20realize%20is%20that%20he%20translated%20that%20to%20mean%20he%20could%20invite%20EVERY%20friend%20to%20his%20party.%20We%20were%20staring%20at%2070%2C%2080%2C%2090%2B%20RSVPs%2C%20and%20the%20count%20kept%20growing%20each%20day.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENot%20only%20that%2C%20but%20the%20weather%20was%20calling%20for%20rain.%20We%20had%20an%20unfinished%20strip%20of%20our%20backyard%20that%20we%20were%20turning%20into%20a%20play%20area%2C%20but%20it%20wouldn't%20be%20ready%20in%20time%20for%20the%20party.%20So%20we%20had%20a%20large%20strip%20of%20dirt%20that%20became%20a%20massive%20mud%20pit.%20%26quot%3BI%20don't%20think%20we%20can%20pull%20this%20off.%26quot%3B%20My%20husband%20stressed%20to%20me.%20%26quot%3BI%20think%20we're%20going%20to%20have%20to%20schedule%20an%20indoor%20venue%20at%20the%20last%20minute.%20I%20don't%20see%20how%20we%20can%20make%20this%20work.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22760%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Kids%20playing%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6cf90e87737bff3ebda28e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22570%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20says%20she%20leaned%20into%20the%20mess.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20living%20remotely%20off-grid%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fleft-off-grid-life-new-mexico-for-walkable-city-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emoving%20to%20a%20walkable%20city%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20was%20leaning%20into%20intentional%20community.%20I%20wanted%20to%20prove%20we%20could%20host%20a%20large%20party%20in%20our%20home%2C%20even%20if%20it%20was%20a%20little%20chaotic.%20We%20updated%20the%20invite%20and%20sent%20all%20of%20our%20RSVPs%20a%20message.%20%26quot%3BMud%20is%20on%20the%20forecast!%20Bring%20rainboots%2C%20a%20towel%2C%20a%20change%20of%20clothes%2C%20and%20a%20flexible%20attitude!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20threw%20every%20pillow%2C%20cushion%2C%20and%20blanket%20we%20could%20find%20into%20our%20bedroom.%20We%20made%20one%20room%20an%20art%20room%20with%20construction%20paper%2C%20magazines%2C%20glue%20sticks%2C%20markers%2C%20and%20more.%20We%20set%20up%20stations%20in%20the%20playroom%20and%20highlighted%20a%20rack%20filled%20with%20hanging%20costumes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%225ae2e2e3-03c6-40ad-bd1f-ecb63439c8c7%5C%22%3EThe%20party%20became%20a%20celebration%20of%20community%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20party%20was%20in%20full%20swing.%20A%20mountain%20of%20shoes%20sat%20by%20our%20front%20door.%20My%20husband%20carried%20old%20yoga%20mats%20up%20from%20the%20basement%20to%20form%20a%20walkway%20from%20the%20back%20door%20to%20our%20bathroom.%20Kids%20dug%20in%20the%20mud%20pit%20with%20hoes%20and%20shovels%20while%20adults%20hosed%20them%20off%20before%20they%20went%20inside.%20People%20in%20the%20gated%20off%20living%20room%20played%20with%20the%20younger%20kids%20while%20talking%20about%20concerts.%20Parents%20leaned%20against%20our%20counters%20in%20the%20kitchen%2C%20conversing%20about%20the%20best%20camping%20spots.%20Upstairs%2C%20one%20parent%20was%20assisting%20with%20putting%20on%20and%20removing%20costumes%20while%20a%20group%20of%20parents%20stood%20on%20our%20landing%2C%20popping%20their%20heads%20into%20each%20room%20to%20see%20if%20anyone%20needed%20anything.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20admired%20how%20everyone%20had%20stepped%20up%20to%20keep%20the%20kids%20safe%2C%20our%20home%20tidy%2C%20and%20the%20laughter%20flowing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Kids%20singing%20happy%20birthday%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6cf934a62e6e00bc5394f2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22760%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20son%20had%20a%20great%20time.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20time%20for%20cake.%20I%20squeezed%20my%20way%20through%20each%20room%20of%20the%20house%2C%20my%20hands%20cupping%20around%20my%20mouth%2C%20hollering%20%26quot%3BCAKE%20IN%205%20MINUTES!!%26quot%3B%20Kids%20squealed%20and%20took%20the%20cue%20to%20wrap%20up%20their%20activity%20and%20head%20to%20the%20front%20room.%20I%20looked%20around%20while%20my%20husband%20placed%20candles%20on%20the%20cake%20and%20nearly%20started%20to%20cry.%20The%20bodies%20filled%20our%20room%2C%20shoulder%20to%20shoulder%2C%20on%20the%20floor%2C%20up%20the%20stairs%2C%20around%20the%20table.%20Everyone%20seemed%20relaxed%2C%20smiling%2C%20and%20present.%20My%20son%20looked%20around%20and%20jumped%20up%20and%20down%2C%20his%20smile%20devouring%20the%20rest%20of%20his%20face.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20didn't%20need%20to%20throw%20money%20toward%20a%20franchise%20to%20give%20our%20son%20the%20best%20day.%20We%20didn't%20need%20an%20epic%20house%20or%20perfect%20weather.%20We%20just%20needed%20open%20communication%2C%20good%20attitudes%2C%20and%20a%20bit%20of%20letting%20go%20of%20typical%20expectations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhosted-90-kids-birthday-party-at-home-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786214401000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6cee03a62e6e00bc53946f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhosted-90-kids-birthday-party-at-home-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20skipped%20the%20expensive%20birthday%20venue%20and%20invited%20all%20of%20my%20son's%20friends%20to%20our%20home.%20It%20turned%20into%20our%20favorite%20party%20yet.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Jayme%20Serbell)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Savarkar%20Question%20In%20Kerala%20School%20Quiz%20Sparks%20Big%20Political%20Row%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22A%20political%20row%20erupted%20in%20Kerala%20over%20a%20question%20in%20a%20school%20quiz%20that%20described%20Hindutva%20ideologue%20V%20D%20Savarkar%20as%20a%20freedom%20fighter%20%26quot%3Bwho%20received%20the%20most%20severe%20punishment%20from%20the%20British%26quot%3B%2C%20prompting%20General%20Education%20Minister%20N%20Samsudheen%20