%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226960%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20cyclists%20ride%20along%20a%20waterfront%20promenade%20with%20a%20modern%20high-rise%20skyline%20across%20the%20water.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a761c888fcc2e955f7de718%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224640%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI'm%20pretty%20psyched%20for%20all%20the%20family%20bike%20rides%20ahead.%3Cp%3ECheng%20Xin%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ETeaching%20a%20kid%20to%20ride%20a%20bike%20is%20hard%2C%20especially%20when%20that%20kid%20is%20your%20own.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAfter%20some%20failed%20lessons%2C%20I%20outsourced%20this%20important%20parenting%20rite%20of%20passage.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20spent%20a%20bunch%20of%20money%20on%20bike%20lessons%2C%20and%20I'd%20do%20it%20again%20in%20a%20heartbeat.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20going%20to%20admit%20something%20here%20that's%20probably%20going%20to%20get%20a%20lot%20of%20parents%20up%20in%20arms%3A%20I%20paid%20a%20guy%20%24300%20to%20teach%20my%20two%20kids%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbiking-everywhere-no-car-bicycle-what-i-learned-2019-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eride%20a%20bike%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20know%20that%20%24150%20for%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbiking-everywhere-no-car-bicycle-what-i-learned-2019-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebike%20lesson%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20exorbitant%2C%20and%20it%20was%20one%20of%20the%20reasons%20I%20hesitated%20to%20do%20it%20(or%20talk%20about%20it%20publicly).%20But%20when%20I%20reframed%20it%20in%20my%20mind%20as%20an%20extremely%20finite%20cost%20for%20a%20job%20I%20could%20not%20do%20myself%2C%20for%20what%20will%20hopefully%20be%20a%20lifetime%20of%20family%20bike%20rides%20%E2%80%94%20I%20decided%20I%20could%20live%20with%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20I%20have%20zero%20regrets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22c171826c-d0d7-4768-a42d-f41c01664582%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20tried%20to%20teach%20our%20kids%20ourselves%20and%20totally%20failed%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20kids%20are%206%20and%208.%20We%20live%20in%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fone-bedroom-apartment-nyc-three-kids-husband-design-hacks-2023-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ENew%20York%20City%20apartment%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20I%20can't%20just%20send%20them%20outside%20to%20futz%20around%20on%20their%20bicycles%20and%20figure%20it%20out%20on%20their%20own.%20My%20husband%20and%20I%20have%20schlepped%20the%20bikes%20to%20a%20local%20blacktop%20a%20handful%20of%20times%20over%20the%20past%20few%20summers%2C%20and%20very%20quickly%20turned%20into%20two%20very%20sweaty%2C%20grumpy%20adults%20with%20two%20very%20sweaty%2C%20grumpy%20kids%20%E2%80%94%20kids%20who%20still%20needed%20training%20wheels.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20you%20ask%2C%20yes%3A%20we%20tried%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fteslas-balance-bike-toddlers-elon-musk-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebalance%20bike%3C%2Fa%3E.%20We%20tried%20training%20wheels%2C%20and%20one%20training%20wheel%20slightly%20lifted%2C%20and%20also%20a%20bike%20trainer%20handle%20that%20was%20supposed%20to%20let%20us%20run%20gracefully%20behind%20the%20bike%20rather%20than%20lurching%20alongside%20the%20tiny%20rider%20while%20holding%20his%20waist.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENone%20of%20it%20clicked.%20Our%20vision%20of%20helmeted%20children%20riding%20proudly%20into%20the%20sunset%20after%20a%20few%20spins%20together%20was%20fading%20with%20each%20failed%20session.%20It%20was%20clear%20we%20needed%20a%20different%20approach.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221600%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22woman%20on%20bicycle%20with%20child%20in%20carrier%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a761ee20c6c5a263f3a7a36%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMy%20daughter%20and%20I%20in%20an%20earlier%20family%20biking%20era.%3Cp%3EJulie%20Zeveloff%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b2803944-9f70-4a17-837b-30a9a5bf071e%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ESometimes%2C%20as%20a%20parent%2C%20you%20have%20to%20know%20your%20limits%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20I%20went%20back%20to%20my%20text%20messages%20to%20dig%20up%20the%20name%20of%20the%20local%20%26quot%3Bbike%20whisperer%2C%26quot%3B%20a%2020-something%20BMXer%20and%20bicycle%20mechanic%20whom%20parents%20turn%20to%20when%20it's%20time%20to%20suck%20up%20their%20pride%20and%20outsource%20this%20sacred%20parenting%20rite%20of%20passage.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20worked%20like%20a%20charm.%20Our%20instructor%20showed%20up%20at%20the%20local%20school%20basketball%20court%20with%20his%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fconnor-fields-out-of-icu-after-brain-hemorrhage-at-olympics-2021-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBMX%20bike%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20a%20bag%20of%20chalk.%20He%20impressed%20my%20kids%20with%20a%20few%20bike%20tricks%20and%20charmed%20them%20by%20writing%20their%20names%20in%20chalk%E2%80%94calligraphy%20for%20my%20daughter%20and%20Minecraft-style%20block%20letters%20for%20my%20son.%20Then%20he%20employed%20a%20series%20of%20steps%20that%20involved%20removing%20their%20pedals%2C%20getting%20them%20to%20find%20their%20balance%2C%20and%20holding%20up%20their%20bikes%20by%20the%20handlebars%20while%20they%20pedaled%20furiously%20into%20the%20air.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20the%20end%20of%20their%2045-minute%20lessons%2C%20each%20one%20was%20comfortably%20riding%20loops%20around%20the%20blacktop%20and%20grinning%20like%20they%20had%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-mt-everest-not-hardest-climb-mountaineers-most-difficult-peaks-2024-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Econquered%20Mt.%20Everest%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2252b699ba-941f-4895-b98a-9288674ab976%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EOur%20bike%20instructor%20took%20the%20emotional%20weight%20out%20of%20the%20situation%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20method%20did%20not%20involve%20running%20alongside%20the%20kids%20while%20holding%20their%20waists%20and%20promising%20loudly%20to%20%26quot%3Bnot%20let%20go!!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMore%20critically%2C%20it%20took%20the%20emotional%20weight%20out%20of%20the%20situation.%20My%20kids%20had%20been%20airing%20their%20frustration%20on%20my%20husband%20and%20me%2C%20and%20we%20on%20them.%20But%20this%20new%20teacher%20was%20cool%20and%20impartial%2C%20and%20brought%20a%20new%20perspective%20to%20the%20challenge.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221179%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22kids%20biking%20and%20scooting%20on%20a%20city%20street%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a761f678fcc2e955f7de743%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22884%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ENew%20York%20City%20sidewalks%20are%20not%20made%20for%20training%20wheels.%3Cp%3EJulie%20Zeveloff%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EPlus%2C%20learning%20to%20ride%20a%20bike%20is%20hard.%20Just%20knowing%20how%20to%20ride%20does%20not%20necessarily%20equip%20a%20parent%20to%20teach%20it%20to%20a%20tiny%2C%20easily%20frustrated%20human%20being.%20Once%20I%20acknowledged%20this%20and%20got%20out%20of%20their%20way%2C%20my%20kids%20were%20primed%20to%20learn%20from%20a%20pro.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20a%20full-time%20working%20parent%2C%20and%20it's%20important%20to%20me%20to%20be%20involved%20in%20my%20kids'%20development%20and%20education.%20There%20are%20lots%20of%20things%20I%20care%20deeply%20about%20teaching%20my%20kids%20myself.%20For%20some%20parents%2C%20that%20absolutely%20involves%20teaching%20their%20kid%20to%20ride%20a%20two-wheeler.%20In%20fact%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fmattyglesias%2Fstatus%2F2080111809952973055%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esome%20of%20them%3C%2Fa%3E%20might%20even%20die%20on%20that%20hill.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20me%2C%20the%20bike%20lesson%20was%20a%20good%20reminder%20that%20even%20the%20most%20involved%20parents%20have%20their%20limits%2C%20and%20sometimes%20it's%20better%20to%20outsource%20to%20an%20expert.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpaid-bike-instructor-teach-kids-ride-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786208161000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a761ca48fcc2e955f7de719%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpaid-bike-instructor-teach-kids-ride-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22After%20repeatedly%20failing%20to%20teach%20my%20kids%20to%20ride%20bikes%2C%20I%20paid%20an%20instructor%20%24300%20to%20do%20it.%20They%20were%20riding%20independently%20within%2045%20minutes.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jzeveloff%40businessinsider.com%20(Julie%20Zeveloff)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Meet%20Costa%20Rica's%20tiny%20'coffee%20frog%2C'%20a%20nocturnal%20species%20found%20living%20among%20coffee%20shrubs%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786207668000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-133055926%2Cimgsize-1923856.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fscience%2Fmeet-costa-ricas-tiny-coffee-frog-a-nocturnal-species-found-living-among-coffee-shrubs%2Farticleshow%2F133055805.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F133055805.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D%5C%2210%5C%22%3EA%20remarkable%20discovery%20in%20Costa%20Rica%20reveals%20a%20diminutive%20nocturnal%20frog%20inhabiting%20the%20coffee%20plantations.%20Measuring%20less%20than%20four%20centimeters%2C%20this%20uniqu