xcited%20to%20move%20our%20home%20again%20when%20we're%20ready.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20partner%20and%20I%20had%20always%20dreamed%20of%20having%20our%20own%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcouple-and-dogs-live-in-tiny-home-on-wheels-2020-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esmall%20space%20on%20wheels%3C%2Fa%3E%20so%20we%20could%20live%20simply%20and%20have%20a%20flexible%20lifestyle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20in%202019%2C%20we%20began%20building%20our%20very%20own%20tiny%20home%20on%20a%2032-foot%20trailer.%20After%20many%20months%20(and%20YouTube%20tutorials)%2C%20it%20was%20complete.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20a%20while%2C%20we%20lived%20in%20it%20while%20parked%20on%20his%20parents'%20property%20in%20New%20Jersey.%20By%202021%2C%20we'd%20decided%20to%20move%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-i-make-my-tiny-home-work-for-me-photos-2022-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E350-square-foot%20build%3C%2Fa%3E%20across%20the%20country%20to%20California%2C%20where%20we'd%20found%20a%20great%20tiny-home%20community%20in%20a%20national%20forest%20about%20an%20hour%20outside%20San%20Diego.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I'd%20been%20nervous%20about%20moving%20our%20home%20for%20the%20first%20time%2C%20it%20worked%20out%20%E2%80%94%20and%20our%20new%20community%20was%20wonderful.%20We%20loved%20taking%20advantage%20of%20our%20easy%20access%20to%20beautiful%20trails%20and%20mountain%20views%20and%20befriended%20our%20neighbors%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20after%20years%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamily-move-mountain-town-away-from-grandparents-struggle-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esecluded%20mountain%20living%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20we%20wanted%20a%20change%20of%20scenery%20and%20to%20be%20closer%20to%20a%20grocery%20store%20%E2%80%94%20the%20nearest%20one%20was%20more%20than%2020%20miles%20away%2C%20about%20a%2035-minute%20drive.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20also%20wanted%20to%20be%20near%20more%20activities%20and%20be%20able%20to%20casually%20take%20pottery%20classes%20nearby%20or%20join%20a%20local%20soccer%20league.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20we%20set%20our%20sights%20on%20Bend%2C%20Oregon.%20We%20had%20friends%20in%20the%20area%20and%20loved%20the%20idea%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftesting-out-island-before-moving-living-90-days-pacific-northwest-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eliving%20in%20the%20Pacific%20Northwest%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20in%20a%20city%20with%20better%20access%20to%20what%20we%20wanted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229ccbfa12-6b4c-4a55-85e9-857690e06d68%5C%22%3EWe%20spent%20a%20few%20months%20preparing%20for%20the%20move%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Interior%20of%20tiny%20home%20with%20kitchen%20area%2C%20loft%20area%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a748ee90c6c5a263f3a6f55%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMoving%20our%20house%20seemed%20daunting%2C%20but%20it%20wasn't%20too%20difficult.%3Cp%3EErica%20Allen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20researching%20reliable%20moving%20companies%2C%20we%20estimated%20it%20would%20cost%20at%20least%20%243%2C000%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerican-moved-family-to-country-never-visited-spain-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erelocate%20our%20house%3C%2Fa%3E.%20So%2C%20for%20months%20leading%20up%20to%20our%20move%2C%20we%20put%20as%20much%20money%20as%20possible%20into%20our%20savings%20account.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20also%20began%20looking%20for%20land%20in%20Bend%20that%20we%20could%20rent%20to%20place%20our%20house%20on.%20Eventually%2C%20we%20found%20a%20spot%20online%20by%20connecting%20with%20homeowners%20in%20the%20area%20who%20were%20interested%20in%20hosting%20us.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20land%20in%20place%2C%20we%20hired%20someone%20to%20drive%20our%20home%20to%20Oregon%20while%20my%20partner%20and%20I%20drove%20down%20separately%20with%20our%20dog.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENext%2C%20we%20needed%20to%20pack.%20On%20the%20bright%20side%2C%20no%20moving%20truck%20is%20needed%20when%20you're%20moving%20your%20actual%20home.%20Instead%2C%20we%20filled%20our%20house.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Boxes%20stacked%20inside%20home%20with%20furniture%20around%20them%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a748eea8fcc2e955f7ddc31%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20filled%20our%20house%20with%20boxes.%3Cp%3EErica%20Allen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20packed%20everything%20from%20our%20shelves%20and%20cabinets%20into%20boxes%2C%20using%20clothes%20to%20wrap%20plates%2C%20pans%2C%20and%20other%20breakables.%20Then%20those%20boxes%20were%20stacked%20and%20packed%20tightly%20in%20our%20living%20room.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20be%20extra%20cautious%2C%20we%20also%20secured%20our%20fridge%20and%20washer%2Fdryer%20to%20the%20walls%20with%20bungee%20cords.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a0abf6ee-cb09-453f-9858-b3bf03a3fe93%5C%22%3EMoving%20day%20wasn't%20perfect%2C%20but%20it%20went%20smoothly%20enough%20%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221179%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20and%20woman%20taking%20selfie%20in%20car%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a748eea0c0bf4e8be5221cb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22772%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOur%20move%20involved%20a%20bit%20of%20faith%20and%20a%20long%20drive.%3Cp%3EErica%20Allen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20day%20of%20the%20move%2C%20we%20dealt%20with%20minor%20car%20troubles%20and%20our%20first%20driver%20canceling%2C%20though%20another%20was%20sent%20in%20their%20place.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20then%2C%20we'd%20already%20decided%20to%20start%20our%20long%20drive%2C%20with%20our%20dog%20in%20tow.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELuckily%2C%20our%20friends%20in%20the%20community%20were%20able%20to%20meet%20the%20new%20driver%20and%20facilitate%20the%20move.%20The%20biggest%20relief%20came%20when%20they%20sent%20us%20videos%20of%20our%20house%20being%20hooked%20up%20and%20safely%20towed%20away.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20the%20beginning%20of%20the%20moving%20day%20didn't%20go%20as%20smoothly%20as%20intended%2C%20the%20rest%20of%20it%20did.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Trees%20next%20to%20mountains%2C%20water%20in%20Bend%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7490ce0c6c5a263f3a6f76%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EBend%20is%20beautiful%2C%20but%20we%20love%20knowing%20we%20can%20move%20our%20home%20again%20whenever%20we're%20ready.%3Cp%3EErica%20Allen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESixteen%20hours%20of%20driving%20later%2C%20we%20met%20the%20driver%20and%20our%20house%20at%20the%20new%20property.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOnce%20we%20arrived%2C%20we%20weren't%20done.%20We%20leveled%20the%20trailer%20and%20added%20bottle%20jacks%20to%20help%20stabilize%20and%20support%20its%20weight.%20Next%2C%20we%20connected%20our%20plumbing%20and%20electricity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20we%20began%20the%20unpacking%20process.%20We%20started%20with%20our%20outdoor%20furniture%2C%20turf%2C%20and%20bikes%20%E2%80%94%20all%20of%20which%20we'd%20transported%20in%20the%20house.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESomehow%2C%20none%20of%20our%20belongings%20or%20furniture%20broke.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224a363796-a703-43b2-b31d-d935e0bb414d%5C%22%3EAlthough%20we%20won't%20stay%20here%20forever%2C%20it's%20great%20for%20now%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20dogs%20in%20yard%20area%20with%20tiny%20home%20in%20distance%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a748eea0c0bf4e8be5221cc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20have%20plenty%20of%20outdoor%20space%20for%20our%20dogs.%3Cp%3EErica%20Allen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20first%20few%20nights%20at%20a%20new%20spot%20are%20always%20my%20favorite.%20There's%20nothing%20like%20looking%20up%20at%20the%20stars%20in%20a%20new%20view%2C%20but%20through%20the%20same%20familiar%20window.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20we%20first%20got%20to%20Oregon%2C%20we%20even%20saw%20the%20northern%20lights.%20New%20experiences%20like%20that%20are%20what%20make%20all%20the%20move%20preparation%2C%20anxiety%2C%20and%20change%20worth%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20far%2C%20our%20new%20spot%20has%20been%20great%2C%20and%20the%20people%20we%20rent%20it%20from%20are%20incredible.%20It's%20been%20convenient%20living%20just%2010%20minutes%20from%20a%20grocery%20store%20and%2015%20minutes%20from%20the%20center%20of%20town.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20have%20our%20own%20yard%20and%20a%20larger%20area%20for%20our%20dog%20to%20play%20%E2%80%94%20and%20we%20even%20ended%20up%20rescuing%20another%20pup.%20We've%20also%20built%20a%20small%20shed%20to%20use%20as%20an%20office%2C%20art%20studio%2C%20and%20gaming%20area.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe're%20enjoying%20living%20here%20for%20now%2C%20but%20we%20would%20move%20our%20home%20again%20when%20we're%20ready%20for%20a%20change.%20With%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiny-home-resort-catskills-tour-inside-260-square-foot-house-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehouse%20on%20wheels%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20it's%20nice%20to%20always%20have%20the%20option.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-tiny-home-to-new-state-better-than-expected-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786204981000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a74958d8fcc2e955f7ddc6c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-tiny-home-to-new-state-better-than-expected-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Moving%20