E2%80%A6%5D%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Naman%20Ramachandran%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20was%20a%20stay-at-home%20mom%20for%2027%20years.%20At%2062%2C%20I%20started%20over%20after%20moving%20to%20Greece.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224184%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman%20in%20a%20yellow%20top%20looking%20out%20onto%20a%20harbor.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a74d1fa8fcc2e955f7ddee2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223138%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EKati%20Gyselinck%20started%20a%20new%20life%20in%20Greece%20at%20the%20age%20of%2062.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Kati%20Gyselinck%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EKati%20Gyselinck%20reflected%20on%20her%2027%20years%20as%20a%20stay-at-home%20mom%20and%20wanted%20a%20change.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAt%2062%2C%20she%20moved%20solo%20to%20the%20Greek%20mainland%20with%20one%20suitcase%2C%20leaving%20everything%20else%20behind.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EShe%20said%20that%20downsizing%20and%20being%20grateful%20for%20the%20smaller%20things%20in%20life%20have%20made%20her%20happier.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20story%20is%20based%20on%20an%20interview%20with%20Kati%20Gyselinck%2C%2065%2C%20a%20life%20coach%20who%20lives%20in%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-things-to-do-athens-greece-what-to-skip-2023-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3EAthens%2C%20Greece%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E.%20It%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20arrived%20at%20Athens%20International%20Airport%20in%20October%202023%20with%20nothing%20but%20a%20suitcase%20full%20of%20clothes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20I%20took%20a%20taxi%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fi-bought-airbnb-made-60000-three-years-2015-07%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20Airbnb%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20was%20supposed%20to%20be%20my%20home%20while%20I%20began%20my%20new%20life%20abroad.%20My%20first%20impressions%20weren't%20great.%20The%20place%20seemed%20dark%2C%20and%20there%20was%20no%20balcony.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20few%20nights%20later%2C%20I%20got%20up%20to%20use%20the%20bathroom%20and%20kicked%20my%20big%20toe%20against%20the%20bed.%20The%20whole%20nail%20came%20off%2C%20and%20the%20pain%20was%20bad.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHave%20you%20started%20a%20new%20life%20abroad%3F%20Please%20email%20Jane%20Ridley%20at%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Ajridley%40insider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Ejridley%40insider.com%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%20if%20you'd%20like%20to%20share%20your%20story%20with%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a1ded485-248a-4508-8883-31618405d967%5C%22%3EI%20wondered%20if%20I'd%20made%20a%20mistake%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20was%20no%20way%20I%20could%20find%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freference%2Ftelemedicine-prescription-online%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20pharmacy%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20that%20time.%20Nor%20did%20I%20have%20anyone%20to%20call.%20It%20brought%20home%20to%20me%20the%20leap%20of%20faith%20I'd%20taken%20to%20move%20to%20another%20country.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BDid%20I%20make%20a%20mistake%3F%26quot%3B%20I%20thought.%20I%20felt%20sorry%20for%20myself%20because%20I%20was%20alone.%20I%20cried%20my%20eyes%20out%20for%20hours.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221179%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman%20walking%20in%20Greece.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a74fe4b0c0bf4e8be5226d3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22884%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EGyselinck%20took%20time%20to%20find%20her%20feet%20in%20Athens.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Kati%20Gyselinck%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20departure%20from%20my%20house%20in%20Israel%2C%20which%20coincided%20with%20a%20divorce%2C%20wasn't%20something%20I'd%20meticulously%20planned.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENevertheless%2C%20I%20needed%20a%20new%20direction.%20My%20three%20kids%20were%20adults%2C%20leading%20their%20own%20lives.%20I'd%20been%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwant-be-tradwife-traditional-wife-marriage-homemaker-life-meaning-2024-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20homemaker%20%3C%2Fa%3Efor%2027%20years.%20It%20had%20reached%20the%20point%20where%20it%20was%20pretty%20much%2C%20%26quot%3BHi%20Mom%2C%20Bye%20Mom%2C%26quot%3B%20as%20they%20rushed%20in%20and%20out%20of%20the%20door.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d1a62dfc-5711-47f5-88b0-0c7871fb8622%5C%22%3EI%20was%20dedicated%20to%20being%20a%20wife%20and%20mother%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20raising%20beautiful%20children%20was%20an%20accomplishment.%20Yet%2C%20I%20couldn't%20help%20thinking%20that%20I%20hadn't%20gotten%20much%20to%20show%20for%20%3Cem%3Emyself.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20been%20dedicated%20to%20the%20role%20of%20wife%20and%20mother%20since%20leaving%20my%20job%20as%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Fmortgages%2Fmortgage-broker%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emortgage%20consultant%20%3C%2Fa%3Ewhen%20my%20son%20was%20born.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20wasn't%20as%20if%20I%20didn't%20enjoy%20being%20with%20the%20kids.%20I'd%20waited%20until%2034%20to%20have%20my%20first%20baby%2C%20feeling%20so%20much%20love%2C%20and%20didn't%20mind%20staying%20at%20home%20without%20a%20nanny.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20was%20a%20successful%20businessman%2C%20and%20our%20finances%20were%20secure.%20Despite%20that%2C%20I%20found%20it%20hard%20to%20no%20longer%20have%20my%20own%20stream%20of%20income.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221179%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman%20on%20a%20beach%20wearing%20sunglasses.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a74feb70c6c5a263f3a743b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22884%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EGyselinck%20lives%20near%20the%20beach%20on%20the%20Athens%20Riviera.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Kati%20Gyselinck%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20years%20went%20by%2C%20and%20I%20hit%2062.%20Things%20had%20been%20building%20up%20for%20a%20while.%20I%20had%20a%20heavy%20feeling%20in%20my%20chest%20because%20I%20wasn't%20where%20I%20wanted%20to%20be.%20I%20had%20material%20things%20like%20a%20big%20car%2C%20but%20I%20was%20convinced%20I%20could%20be%20happier%20with%20a%20lot%20less.%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3EI%20thought%20about%20staying%20for%20a%20few%20more%20years%2C%20until%20my%20youngest%20was%20in%20her%20mid-20s%2C%20but%20by%20then%20I'd%20be%2067%20or%2068.%20Almost%20on%20the%20spur%20of%20the%20moment%2C%20I%20opted%20for%20a%20fresh%20start%20in%20Athens.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22889c41e8-6a9b-4f2d-837d-a994003b28ea%5C%22%3EI%20walked%206%20miles%20a%20day%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20loved%20Greece%20ever%20since%20I%20went%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcruises-what-not-pay-extra-for-waste-money-frequent-traveler-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eon%20a%20cruise%3C%2Fa%3E%20off%20the%20coast.%20The%20people%20are%20very%20friendly.%20And%20it's%20an%20easy%20flight%20from%20Tel%20Aviv.%20My%20kids%20can%20visit%20me%20within%20a%20day%20of%20travel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20it%20took%20me%20almost%20a%20year%20to%20find%20my%20feet.%20The%20night%20when%20I%20hurt%20my%20toe%20wasn't%20the%20only%20time%20I%20wondered%20if%20I'd%20done%20the%20right%20thing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20the%20issues%20was%20not%20finding%20an%20Airbnb%20that%20I%20was%20comfortable%20in.%20I%20didn't%20like%20living%20with%20other%20people's%20furnishings%2C%20when%20I%20was%20used%20to%20choosing%20my%20own.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERather%20than%20stay%20home%2C%20I'd%20walk%20for%20hours%2C%20exploring%20the%20neighborhoods.%20I%20clocked%20five%20or%20six%20miles%20a%20day%20on%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftim-cook-visions-predictions-for-apple-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20Watch%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman%20in%20a%20white%20shirt%20holding%20up%20a%20glass%20of%20white%20wine.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a74ff3d8fcc2e955f7de121%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221737%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EGyselinck%20enjoys%20eating%20out%20alone.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Kati%20Gyselinck%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20deliberately%20chose%20a%20big%20city%20because%2C%20as%20a%20single%20woman%2C%20it%20seemed%20it%20would%20be%20easier%20to%20make%20friends.%20Slowly%2C%20but%20surely%2C%20I%20found%20people%20I%20wanted%20to%20hang%20out%20with%2C%20including%20a%20couple%20I%20met%20in%20a%20caf%C3%A9.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20the%20guys%20lived%20in%20the%20Athens%20Riviera%2C%20about%2025%20miles%20south.%20He%20knew%20I%20wasn't%20100%25%20OK%20in%20the%20city%2C%20and%20suggested%20I%20check%20out%20some%20properties%20near%20him.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20December%2C%202024%2C%20I%20rented%20a%201%2C300%20square%20foot%2C%20three-bedroom%20apartment%2C%20a%20few%20minutes'%20walk%20from%20the%20shore.%20It%20wasn't%20furnished%2C%20and%20I%20transformed%20it%20to%20my%20taste.%20I%20bought%20a%20compact%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftop-cheapest-evs-electric-vehicles-cars-2024-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFiat%20500%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b81f1605-0451-44f7-9000-d6ebdac9403d%5C%22%3EFood%20is%20fresh%20here%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EDownsizing%20did%20me%20good%2C%20as%20I'd%20suspected.%20I%20had%20never%20been%20one%20to%20chase%20designer%20bags%20or%20anything%20like%20that%2C%20but%20I%20developed%20an%20appreciation%20of%20the%20simpler%20things.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20swam%20in%20the%20ocean%20every%20morning%2C