%3D%5C%22897%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIt%20took%20me%20a%20while%20to%20find%20ways%20to%20actually%20practice%20my%20French.%3Cp%3EJodie%20Hughes%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20spoken%20French%20fluently-ish%20as%20a%20teen%2C%20but%20I'd%20barely%20used%20so%20much%20as%20a%20%26quot%3Bbonjour%26quot%3B%20in%20the%20four%20years%20prior%20to%20my%20relocation.%20I%20was%20worried%20about%20the%20rustiness%20of%20my%20speaking%20skills%2C%20envisioning%20it%20causing%20real%20difficulties%20in%20day-to-day%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20I%20also%20assumed%20that%2C%20since%20I%20would%20be%20totally%20immersed%20in%20the%20language%2C%20my%20French%20would%20come%20back%20in%20no%20time.%20I%20was%20wrong%20on%20both%20counts.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20practically%20everyone%20I%20encountered%20in%20Paris%20spoke%20English%2C%20my%20subpar%20French%20proved%20no%20obstacle%20at%20all.%20In%20fact%2C%20no%20matter%20how%20much%20I%20%3Cem%3Etried%3C%2Fem%3E%20to%20speak%20French%2C%20in%20restaurants%2C%20in%20shops%2C%20on%20the%20metro%2C%20at%20the%20bank%2C%20you%20name%20it%20%E2%80%A6%20most%20people%20simply%20replied%20to%20me%20in%20English.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20a%20blessing%20and%20a%20curse%3B%20simultaneously%20very%20convenient%20for%20going%20about%20my%20life%2C%20and%20very%20%3Cem%3Ein%3C%2Fem%3Econvenient%20for%20improving%20my%20French.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20I%20worked%20in%20English%2C%20and%20the%20first%20friends%20I%20made%20were%20all%20other%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fliving-abroad-feel-like-home-diplomat-life-coach-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Einternational%20expats%3C%2Fa%3E%20(who%20spoke%20English%20together)%2C%20my%20opportunities%20to%20hone%20my%20language%20skills%20were%20virtually%20nonexistent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEventually%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchanged-location-dating-app-found-love-outside-united-states-hinge