hought%20to%20myself%2C%20with%20completely%20unfounded%20confidence.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20internet%20tried%20to%20warn%20me%2C%20but%20I%20didn't%20listen.%20Most%20essential%20tasks%2C%20like%20getting%20a%20social-security%20number%20and%20a%20health%20card%2C%20took%20way%20longer%20and%20required%20more%20effort%20than%20I%20expected.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20imagine%20this%20may%20be%20the%20case%20when%20relocating%20to%20any%20new%20country.%20However%2C%20even%20after%20nearly%20a%20decade%20of%20living%20here%2C%20I%20still%20dread%20dealing%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerican-moved-to-paris-challenging-career-social-life-healthcare-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFrench%20bureaucratic%20systems%3C%2Fa%3E%20(and%20all%20the%20paperwork%20they%20require).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20takeaway%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Be%20patient%2C%20set%20aside%20dedicated%20time%20to%20tackle%20essential%20relocation%20tasks%2C%20and%20take%20a%20lot%20of%20deep%20breaths.%20Getting%20a%20French%20phone%20number%20as%20soon%20as%20possible%20will%20also%20make%20administrative%20tasks%20(and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsurprising-things-living-in-paris-as-american-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elife%20in%20Paris%3C%2Fa%3E)%20a%20lot%20easier.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cf410e69-baf9-44e0-adf6-d288b1f484c1%5C%22%3EParis%20lives%20up%20to%20its%20chic%20reputation%2C%20but%20I%20didn't%20have%20to%20worry%20so%20much%20about%20my%20style%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224283%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Back%20of%20woman%20wearing%20bow's%20head%20as%20she%20looks%20at%20Notre%20Dame%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6d01c197a2276a3423c0e0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223780%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20feel%20comfortable%20wearing%20what%20I%20want%20in%20Paris%20these%20days.%3Cp%3EJodie%20Hughes%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EPre-Paris%2C%20I%20worried%20I'd%20look%20out%20of%20place%20or%20underdressed%20because%20of%20this%20city's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstyle-mistakes-american-women-make-2018-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ereputation%20for%20being%20ultra-chic%3C%2Fa%3E.%20(I'm%20no%20fashionista.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20I%20quickly%20discovered%20that%20it's%20very%20difficult%20to%20be%20either%20underdressed%20%3Cem%3Eor%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-to-wear-paris-accoriding-to-parisian-style-fashion-influencers-2023-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eoverdressed%20in%20Paris%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESomething%20I%20found%20very%20refreshing%20when%20I%20moved%20to%20France%20was%20how%20much%20less%20%26quot%3Buniform%26quot%3B%20the%20clothing%20felt%20compared%20to%20the%20UK.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EVery%20extravagant%20or%20outlandish%20ensembles%20would%20raise%20more%20of%20an%20eyebrow%20here%20than%20in%2C%20say%2C%20London%20or%20New%20York%2C%20but%20as%20a%20general%20rule%2C%20at%20any%20given%20activity%2C%20occasion%2C%20or%20gathering%2C%20you'll%20see%20a%20real%20range%20of%20styles%20and%20levels%20of%20%26quot%3Bdressiness.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWithin%20a%20year%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerican-moved-to-paris-left-behind-more-than-expected-drawbacks-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emoving%20to%20Paris%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20felt%20able%20to%20dress%20in%20a%20way%20that%20was%20much%20truer%20to%20my%20personal%20tastes%20than%20I'd%20ever%20felt%20comfortable%20doing%20in%20England.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20takeaway%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWear%20whatever%20you%20want.%20Style%20here%20feels%20generally%20understated%2C%20but%20there's%20no%20Paris%20%26quot%3Buniform.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2220a57dba-f180-4485-9dd9-484ec3fee7cf%5C%22%3ESundays%20are%20way%20sleepier%20than%20I'm%20used%20to%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAround%20the%20time%20I%20moved%2C%20Galeries%20Lafayette%20was%20advertising%20that%20they%20would%20%26quot%3Bnow%26quot%3B%20be%20opening%20on%20Sundays%2C%20and%20it%20really%20confused%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20couldn't%20believe%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-department-stores-in-the-world-2016-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eworld-famous%20department%20store%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20a%20capital%20city%20like%20Paris%20wasn't%20open%20on%20Sundays%20before.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETurns%20out%2C%20a%20lot%20of%20places%20in%20France%20are%20closed%20on%20Sundays%2C%20which%20local%20labor%20laws%20have%20helped%20designate%20as%20a%20day%20of%20rest.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20exceptions%2C%20and%20I've%20seen%20more%20stores%20extend%20their%20hours%20over%20the%20past%20nine%20years.%20However%2C%20I've%20found%20it's%20still%20very%20hit-and-miss%20whether%20(and%2C%20if%20so%2C%20when)%20I'll%20be%20able%20to%20shop%20on%20the%20Day%20of%20Rest.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20say%20roughly%20half%20the%20shops%20I%20frequent%20are%20open%20on%20Sundays%2C%20and%20a%20lot%20of%20supermarkets%20operate%20on%20a%20sort%20of%20%26quot%3Bcompromise%26quot%3B%20model.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20only%20open%20in%20the%20mornings%2C%20and%20others%20are%20open%20all%20day%20but%20have%20security%20staff%20only%2C%20meaning%20there%20are%20limitations%20on%20how%20you%20pay%2C%20and%20you%20can't%20buy%20alcohol.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20seen%20shops%20advertise%20their%20Sunday%20opening%20time%20but%20not%20their%20closing%20time.%20Which%2C%20as%20far%20as%20I%20can%20tell%2C%20means%20they%20close%20whenever%20they%20feel%20like%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20been%20caught%20out%20more%20than%20once%20when%20I've%20gone%20to%20grab%20dinner%20ingredients%2C%20only%20to%20find%20the%20shop%20closed%20an%20hour%20earlier%20than%20it%20had%20the%20previous%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20takeaway%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Don't%20rely%20on%20buying%20your%20groceries%20(or%20anything%20else%20important)%20on%20Sundays.%20If%20you%20need%20to%20purchase%20alcohol%2C%20say%20for%20a%20Sunday%20lunch%20or%20soir%C3%A9e%2C%20make%20sure%20you%20do%20it%20the%20day%20before.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228b4872b2-f187-43cc-867c-2fbb017bae16%5C%22%3EMy%20expectations%20around%20vacation%20have%20completely%20shifted%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226171%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Row%20of%20empty%20cafe%20chairs%20in%20PAris%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a70cd92a62e6e00bc539ddc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIn%20Paris%2C%20a%20lot%20of%20businesses%20closed%20on%20Sunday%20or%20have%20adjusted%20hours.%3Cp%3EKarl%20Hendon%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAbout%20half%20the%20country%20packs%20up%20and%20goes%20on%20vacation%20for%20the%20whole%20of%20July%20%E2%80%A6%20and%20the%20other%20half%2C%20for%20the%20whole%20of%20August.%20This%20includes%20the%20people%20running%20shops%2C%20restaurants%2C%20offices%2C%20and%20all%20kinds%20of%20other%20services.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wish%20I'd%20known%20about%20this%20before%20I%20was%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20experiencing%20it.%20That%20first%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftraveled-with-grandparents-internationally-got-closer-learned-about-them-paris-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esummer%20I%20spent%20in%20Paris%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20very%20long%2C%20very%20hot%2C%20and%20very%20quiet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEverything%20had%20kind%20of%20ground%20to%20a%20halt%20at%20work%2C%20my%20friends%20were%20gone%20for%20huge%20swaths%20of%20time%2C%20and%20most%20of%20my%20go-to%20spots%20for%20eating%20or%20drinking%20out%20were%20closed%20for%20a%20month%20or%20more.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20days%2C%20I%20really%20enjoy%20the%20tranquility%20of%20Paris%20when%20half%20the%20residents%20have%20migrated%20south%20for%20the%20summer%2C%20but%20it%20was%20a%20bizarre%20experience%20to%20be%20unprepared%20for.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20definitely%20wished%20I%20could%20have%20taken%20advantage%20of%20the%20French%20norm%20of%20booking%20multiple%20consecutive%20weeks%20off%20to%20get%20away%20from%20the%20stifling%20city.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20takeaway%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Make%20the%20most%20of%20the%20expectation%20that%20you'll%20take%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmore-americans-are-ditching-summer-vacations-while-others-spend-more-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elong%20summer%20vacation%20%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%94%20even%20if%20it's%20just%20to%20enjoy%20the%20peace%20of%20Paris%20sans%20(half%20the)%20Parisians.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%2C%20expect%20more%20shops%2C%20restaurants%2C%20and%20other%20businesses%20to%20be%20closed%20in%20July%20and%20August.%20Even%20getting%20a%20medical%20appointment%20can%20be%20trickier%20during%20these%20summer%20months.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-from-uk-to-paris-biggest-challenges-language-culture-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786201261000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a70c6c187737bff3ebdab40%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-from-uk-to-paris-biggest-challenges-language-culture-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Some%20of%20the%20biggest%20challenges%20of%20moving%20to%20Paris%20from%20the%20UK%20weren't%20what%20I%20expected%2C%20from%20language%20barriers%20to%20vacation%20culture%20to%20fashion.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Jodie%20Hughes)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22'Toxic'%20trailer%20X%20review%3A%20Yash's%20nude%20scene%20leaves%20fans%20shocked%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22publi