0sequences%20and%20a%20romantic%20storyline.%20The%20film%20is%20set%20against%20Goa's%20drug%20trade%20and%20mafia%20networks.%20'Toxic'%20is%20scheduled%20for%20a%20worldwide%20theatrical%20release%20on%20August%2026.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TOI%20Entertainment%20Desk%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A92%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20saved%20over%20%241%2C900%20on%20my%20family%20trip%20to%20Orlando%20using%20credit%20card%20points.%20These%20are%20the%20hacks%20I%20used.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223167%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Four%20visitors%20sit%20on%20a%20stone%20wall%20among%20greenery%20near%20a%20rocky%20themed%20cave%20entrance.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a737b5df9ea6266446ef138%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222375%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20(second%20from%20right)%20used%20credit%20card%20points%20to%20save%20on%20her%20Orlando%20family%20trip.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lisa%20Galek%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EOur%20six-day%20Orlando%20trip%20for%20a%20family%20of%20five%20cost%20about%20%248%2C620.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EBy%20opening%20credit%20cards%20before%20our%20trip%2C%20we%20were%20able%20to%20earn%20points.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20then%20used%20those%20points%20to%20redeem%20a%20lot%20of%20our%20travel%20expenses%2C%20reducing%20the%20cost.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20started%20planning%20our%20family's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-family-spent-budget-trip-disney-world-universal-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDisney%20and%20Universal%20vacation%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20knew%20it%20wouldn't%20be%20cheap.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20six-day%20Orlando%20trip%20for%20a%20family%20of%20five%20cost%20about%20%248%2C620%2C%20including%20airfare%2C%20hotels%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisney-cost-before-after-ticket-prices-food-breakdown-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etheme%20park%20tickets%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20airport%20transportation%2C%20meals%2C%20and%20other%20travel%20expenses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20I%20started%20looking%20for%20a%20way%20to%20offset%20some%20of%20those%20costs%20using%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Fcredit-cards%2Fhow-to-maximize-credit-card-rewards%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecredit%20card%20rewards%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Over%20time%2C%20I%20earned%20enough%20rewards%20to%20save%20about%20%241%2C920%20on%20our%20vacation%2C%20bringing%20our%20final%20out-of-pocket%20cost%20down%20to%20roughly%20%246%2C700.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ad51a8f3-3376-4173-b2f5-b6ea90e42134%5C%22%3EWe%20first%20researched%20different%20credit%20cards%20and%20planned%20ahead%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20key%20was%20timing%20our%20credit%20card%20applications%20to%20take%20advantage%20of%20their%20generous%20welcome%20bonuses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENeither%20my%20husband%20nor%20I%20had%20previously%20held%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Fcredit-cards%2Fcapital-one-venture-card-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECapital%20One%20Venture%20Rewards%3C%2Fa%3E%20credit%20card%2C%20so%20we%20each%20qualified%20for%20the%20new-cardmember%20welcome%20offer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20learned%20that%20at%20the%20time%2C%20the%20card%20offered%2075%2C000%20bonus%20miles%20after%20spending%20%244%2C000%20within%20the%20first%20three%20months.%20Since%20those%20miles%20can%20be%20redeemed%20to%20cover%20eligible%20travel%20purchases%2C%20this%20welcome%20bonus%20was%20worth%20%24750.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20I%20opened%20my%20card%2C%20I%20realized%20I%20could%20also%20%26quot%3Brefer%26quot%3B%20my%20husband%20for%20his%20own%20card.%20This%20earned%20me%20an%20additional%2020%2C000%20miles%20as%20a%20referral%20bonus%2C%20worth%20%24200.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20opening%20one%20card%20in%20my%20name%20and%20another%20in%20my%20husband's%20name%2C%20we%20earned%20two%20separate%20welcome%20bonuses%20totaling%20%241%2C500.%20Between%20the%20welcome%20bonuses%2C%20referral%20bonus%2C%20and%20miles%20earned%20from%20our%20everyday%20spending%2C%20we%20accumulated%20%241%2C920.75%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Fcredit-cards%2Fbest-travel-rewards-credit-cards%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etravel%20rewards%3C%2Fa%3E%20before%20we%20even%20set%20foot%20in%20Florida.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224032c58f-4173-48e4-b472-eea407ea890b%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20put%20all%20expenses%20on%20the%20credit%20cards%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20applied%20for%20the%20cards%20several%20months%20before%20our%20trip%2C%20knowing%20we%20had%20enough%20upcoming%20expenses%20to%20comfortably%20meet%20the%20%244%2C000%20minimum%20spending%20requirement%20within%20three%20months%20without%20buying%20anything%20we%20didn't%20already%20intend%20to%20purchase.%20We%20charged%20items%20like%20meals%2C%20groceries%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faverage-cost-monthly-household-bills-change-pandemic-covid-rent-mortgage-2024-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehousehold%20bills%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20our%20upcoming%20travel%20expenses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20important%20that%20we%20only%20used%20the%20cards%20for%20purchases%20we%20were%20already%20planning%20to%20make%20and%20paid%20the%20balances%20in%20full%20each%20month.%20Otherwise%2C%20we%20could%20have%20ended%20up%20carrying%20debt%20or%20paying%20interest%2C%20which%20would%20quickly%20erase%20any%20savings%20we%20gained%20from%20the%20rewards.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOnce%20the%20travel%20charges%20were%20posted%20to%20our%20accounts%2C%20we%20used%20Capital%20One's%20%26quot%3BCover%20Travel%20Purchases%26quot%3B%20feature%20to%20redeem%20miles%20for%20statement%20credits.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fcee48ca-c68d-4b0c-9909-6bfb2c1f2d52%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ENot%20every%20Disney%20expense%20counted%20as%20travel%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20lesson%20I%20learned%20is%20that%20merchant%20coding%20matters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20Universal%20Orlando%20expenses%2C%20for%20example%2C%20were%20coded%20as%20%26quot%3Btravel%2C%26quot%3B%20making%20them%20eligible%20for%20redemption.%20That%20included%20our%20hotel%20and%20Universal%20theme%20park%20tickets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDisney%20purchases%20were%20more%20complicated.%20Theme%20park%20tickets%20purchased%20directly%20from%20Disney%20are%20coded%20as%20%26quot%3Bentertainment%26quot%3B%20rather%20than%20%26quot%3Btravel%2C%26quot%3B%20so%20we%20couldn't%20redeem%20our%20Venture%20miles%20to%20erase%20those%20charges.%20The%20same%20was%20true%20for%20Lightning%20Lane%20pass%20purchases%20from%20Disney.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFortunately%2C%20we%20had%20more%20than%20enough%20eligible%20travel%20expenses%20to%20redeem%20all%20of%20our%20rewards.%20We%20applied%20our%20miles%20toward%20two%20of%20our%20biggest%20vacation%20costs%3A%20about%20%241%2C451%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Funlimited-flight-pass-unique-graduation-gift-teaching-life-skills-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFrontier%20airfare%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20roughly%20%244%2C948%20for%20our%20Universal%20hotel%20stay%20and%20theme%20park%20tickets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20we%20had%20needed%20another%20eligible%20travel%20purchase%2C%20buying%20theme%20park%20tickets%20through%20a%20third-party%20travel%20agency%20that%20codes%20as%20travel%20%E2%80%94%20such%20as%20Undercover%20Tourist%20%E2%80%94%20could%20have%20been%20another%20option.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20a%20reminder%20that%20before%20counting%20on%20points%20to%20cover%20an%20expense%2C%20it's%20worth%20checking%20how%20that%20merchant%20is%20likely%20to%20code%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2213148ecc-c237-4dad-a590-b3fccd102df6%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20savings%20went%20beyond%20the%20welcome%20bonus%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20welcome%20bonuses%20accounted%20for%20most%20of%20our%20savings%2C%20but%20they%20weren't%20the%20only%20perk.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Venture%20card%20reimbursed%20my%20husband%20and%20me%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftsa-precheck-etiquette-get-through-airport-security-fast%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETSA%20PreCheck%3C%2Fa%3E%20application%20fees%2C%20a%20benefit%20worth%20%2476.75%20per%20person%2C%20for%20a%20total%20of%20%24153.50.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20simply%20charged%20the%20application%20fees%20to%20each%20of%20our%20cards%2C%20and%20Capital%20One%20automatically%20issued%20statement%20credits.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224e25e054-df27-4519-b99d-48534ed01dc6%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThis%20strategy%20isn't%20for%20everyone%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ETravel%20rewards%20can%20be%20incredibly%20valuable%2C%20but%20they're%20only%20worthwhile%20if%20you're%20prepared%20to%20use%20them%20responsibly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpening%20new%20credit%20cards%20can%20temporarily%20affect%20your%20credit%20score%2C%20so%20this%20approach%20works%20best%20for%20people%20with%20good%20credit%20who%20pay%20their%20balances%20in%20full%20every%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20important%20to%20note%20that%20this%20card%20does%20carry%20a%20%2495%20annual%20fee.%20Since%20we%20each%20opened%20a%20card%2C%20we%20paid%20%24190%20in%20annual%20fees.%20Even%20after%20accounting%20for%20those%20costs%2C%20the%20value%20we%20received%20far%20exceeded%20what%20we%20paid.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20the%20annual%20fee%20comes%20due%20next%20year%2C%20we'll%20evaluate%20whether%20the%20card's%20ongoing%20benefits%20justify%20keeping%20it.%20If%20not%2C%20we%20can%20consider%20downgrading%20to%20a%20no-annual-fee%20version%20or%20closing%20the%20account.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20our%20family%2C%20though%2C%20the%20math%20was%20easy.%20Our%20Orlando%20vacation%20cost%20thousands%20of%20dollars%2C%20but%20redeeming%20%241%2C920%20in%20travel%20rewards%20dramatically%20reduced%20our%20out-of-pocket%20costs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'll%20absolutely%20use%20this%20strategy%20again%20before%20another%20big%20trip.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsaved-family-trip-orlando-using-credit-card-points-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786195021000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a737b474327cd5a0ae2ed60%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsaved-family-trip-orlando-using-credit-card-points-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Our%20six-day%20Orlando%20trip%20for%20a%20family%20of%20five%20cost%20about%20%248%2C620.%20But%20I%20strategized%20beforehand%20to%20earn%20credit%20card%20points%20that%20reduced%20the%20cost.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Lisa%20Galek)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Trump's%20ex-lawyer%20Todd%20Blanche%20narrowly%20confirmed%20as%20US%20attorney%20general%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786194727000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fichef.bbci.co.uk%2Face%2Fbranded_news%2F1200%2Fcpsprodpb%2F136a%2Flive%2F52b81650-930d-11f1-a52f-31e1c3a4e20b.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fcewr898jy8go%230%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20vote%20cements%20Trump's%20former%20criminal%20defence%20lawyer%20as%20the%20nation's%20top%20law%20enforcement%20official%20despite%20a%20rare%20pushback%20from%20some%20Republicans.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fcewr898jy8go%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Irish%20government%20jet%20flies%2