orts%20in%20the%20office%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0on%20Monday's%20episode%20of%20the%20%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DzHaardIm2rE%26t%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3EThrowing%20Fits%3C%2Fu%3E%26quot%3B%20podcast%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20head%20of%20Instagram%20said%20he's%20%26quot%3Bpro%2C%26quot%3B%20though%20%26quot%3Bnot%20everyone%20can%20pull%20them%20off%2C%20and%20not%20all%20shorts%20are%20created%20equal.%26quot%3B%20But%2C%20he%20added%2C%20%26quot%3BWhen%20it%20hits%2C%20it%20hits.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMosseri%20does%20lead%20one%20of%20the%20largest%20social%20media%20platforms%2C%20so%20he%20likely%20has%20more%20flexibility%20with%20his%20work%20wardrobe%20than%20most%20of%20us.%20Still%2C%20a%20professional%20stylist%20says%20he%20has%20a%20point%3A%20Workers%20%3Cem%3Ecan%20%3C%2Fem%3Ewear%20shorts%20to%20the%20office.%20They%20just%20have%20to%20follow%20a%20few%20style%20rules.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223855%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20man%20wears%20black%20dress%20shorts%20with%20white%20ankle%20socks%20and%20black%20loafers.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a75ddc38fcc2e955f7de437%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222891%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThere's%20an%20unspoken%20etiquette%20to%20wearing%20shorts%20at%20work.%3Cp%3EPicture%20Alliance%2FDPA%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22c298da76-9898-4b2b-9ac5-a95f96fff2ac%5C%22%3EYes%2C%20you%20can%20wear%20shorts%20at%20work%20%E2%80%94%20sometimes%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20ask%20the%20general%20public%2C%20most%20people%20will%20probably%20advise%20against%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fare-shorts-appropriate-work-office-reader-survey-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eshowing%20your%20legs%20at%20work%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20least%2C%20that's%20where%20most%20people%20landed%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fposts%2Fbusinessinsider_careers-corporate-etiquette-activity-7490896946065199104-eujn%3Futm_source%3Dsocial_share_send%26utm_medium%3Dmember_desktop_web%26rcm%3DACoAAAFdSG8BNWqDNVEp1XbxdZAlKulQrQBW0Xk%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider's%20LinkedIn%20poll%3C%2Fa%3E%20asking%20whether%20shorts%20at%20the%20office%20are%20appropriate.%20Over%207%2C000%20people%20have%20responded%20so%20far%2C%20with%2055%25%20voting%20%26quot%3Bno%26quot%3B%20and%2020%25%20voting%20%26quot%3Byes.%26quot%3B%20Meanwhile%2C%2025%25%20said%20that%20%26quot%3Bit%20depends.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENaturally%2C%20this%20debate%20found%20its%20way%20into%20my%20conversations%20with%20friends%20and%20family%2C%20and%20everyone%20I%20talked%20to%20was%20somewhere%20in%20the%20middle.%20So%20I%20texted%20an%20expert.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-stylists-busy-professionals-mainstream-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EZahra%20Waliji%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20a%20stylist%20who%20dresses%20everyday%20people%20and%20corporate%20workers%2C%20told%20me%20that%20wearing%20shorts%20in%20the%20office%20can%20be%20fair%20game.%20After%20all%2C%20it's%20about%20a%20lot%20more%20than%20style.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20light%20trousers%20can%20feel%20like%20too%20much%20fabric%20on%20hot%20days.%20And%20while%20women%20generally%20have%20the%20option%20to%20wear%20skirts%20and%20dresses%2C%20they%20can%20still%20be%20thick%20and%20overwhelming.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShorts%20can%20be%20an%20easy%20swap%20for%20anyone.%20They're%20light%2C%20breezy%2C%20and%20comfortable.%20So%20long%20as%20your%20office%20culture%20allows%20it%2C%20Waliji%20said%20workers%20should%20feel%20empowered%20to%20wear%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20definitely%20think%20women%20can%20wear%20shorts%20%5Bin%20the%20office%5D.%20For%20men%2C%20it's%20a%20little%20trickier%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said%2C%20explaining%20that%20there%20are%20simply%20fewer%20