d%20across%20the%20country%20to%20live%20with%20them.%20My%20dad's%20recent%20diagnosis%20made%20me%20grateful%20we%20did.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221706%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20author%20and%20her%20father%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a70aed2a62e6e00bc539c66%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221280%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20and%20her%20family%20moved%20home%20to%20live%20with%20her%20parents%2C%20and%20months%20later%2C%20her%20father%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20Parkinson's.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Melissa%20Noble%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EOn%20a%20trip%20to%20see%20my%20parents%20last%20year%2C%20a%20conversation%20with%20my%20dad%20left%20a%20lasting%20impression%20on%20me.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20felt%20an%20overwhelming%20pull%20to%20move%20my%20family%20back%20to%20the%20Gold%20Coast%20and%20live%20near%20my%20parents.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMy%20family%20has%20been%20living%20with%20them%20this%20year%2C%20and%20in%20June%2C%20my%20dad%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20Parkinson's.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20always%20been%20a%20little%20woo-woo.%20Throughout%20my%20life%2C%20I've%20had%20this%20strange%20sense%20that%20the%20universe%20was%20guiding%20me%20in%20a%20particular%20direction.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELooking%20back%2C%20I%20can%20also%20pinpoint%20a%20handful%20of%20sliding%20door%20moments%20that%20drastically%20changed%20the%20course%20of%20my%20life.%20Last%20July%2C%20I%20experienced%20one%20of%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20holidaying%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-australia-no-regrets-cheaper-sunshine-2024-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eon%20the%20Gold%20Coast%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20where%20my%20parents%20live%2C%20sitting%20in%20a%20park%20with%20my%20dad%20while%20my%20three%20kids%20played%20nearby.%20Out%20of%20nowhere%2C%20my%20dad%20began%20to%20tell%20me%20how%20much%20he%20loved%20me%20and%20what%20a%20wonderful%20daughter%20I'd%20been.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20already%20noticed%20subtle%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdad-senior-living-single-working-mom-couldnt-care-for-him-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Echanges%20in%20my%20dad's%20health%3C%2Fa%3E%20during%20that%20trip%2C%20and%20somehow%20the%20conversation%20felt%20like%20a%20goodbye.%20For%20the%20first%20time%2C%20I%20was%20struck%20by%20the%20terrifying%20realization%20that%20my%20time%20with%20my%20parents%20was%20running%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fda7871c-0886-4d3a-8ba6-c80badb8227c%5C%22%3ESomething%20told%20me%20to%20move%20back%20home%20and%20be%20with%20my%20parents%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20flew%20back%20to%20country%20Victoria%2C%20I%20couldn't%20shake%20the%20overwhelming%20feeling%20that%20I%20needed%20to%20go%20home%20and%20be%20with%20my%20parents.%20I'd%20been%20living%20away%20from%20them%20for%2015%20years%2C%20always%20saying%20I'd%20move%20back%20%26quot%3Bone%20day.%26quot%3B%20But%20this%20felt%20different.%20It's%20hard%20to%20explain%2C%20but%20deep%20down%20I%20felt%20like%20it%20was%20now%20or%20never.%20After%20some%20convincing%2C%20my%20husband%20agreed%20to%20try%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMoving%20interstate%20as%20a%20family%20of%20five%20is%20no%20small%20undertaking.%20Over%20the%20next%20few%20months%2C%20we%20were%20under%20tremendous%20stress%20to%20make%20the%20move%20happen.%20My%20husband%20had%20to%20figure%20out%20what%20to%20do%20with%20his%20remedial%20massage%20and%20myotherapy%20clinics%20in%20Victoria%2C%20while%20I%20focused%20on%20finding%20the%20right%20school%20for%20our%20kids.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMore%20than%20once%2C%20I%20questioned%20whether%20we%20were%20making%20the%20right%20decision%2C%20but%20the%20feeling%20never%20left%20me.%20It%20was%20like%20the%20universe%20was%20nudging%20me%20forward.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20January%2C%20we%20packed%20up%20our%20belongings%20and%20left%20them%20in%20storage%20at%20my%20husband's%20parents'%20place%2C%20then%20drove%20up%20the%20east%20coast%20of%20Australia%20in%20two%20cars.%20As%20we%20crossed%20the%20New%20South%20Wales%20border%20into%20Queensland%20and%20saw%20the%20sign%20saying%2C%20%26quot%3BWelcome%20to%20the%20Gold%20Coast%2C%26quot%3B%20tears%20streamed%20down%20my%20cheeks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20had%20taken%20me%20a%20long%20time%2C%20but%20I%20was%20finally%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20then%2C%20we've%20been%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmultigenerational-living-positive-experience-despite-challenges-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eliving%20with%20my%20parents%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20making%20memories%20together.%20There%20have%20been%20challenges%2C%20particularly%20for%20my%20husband%2C%20who%20has%20had%20to%20open%20a%20new%20remedial%20massage%20clinic%20and%20start%20from%20scratch.%20But%20in%20June%2C%20something%20happened%20that%20confirmed%2C%20beyond%20any%20doubt%20in%20my%20mind%2C%20that%20we'd%20made%20the%20right%20decision.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228eee0526-67a7-4215-b422-3711e2fc3aea%5C%22%3EMy%20dad's%20Parkinson's%20diagnosis%20confirmed%20it%20was%20the%20right%20decision%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20Sunday%20morning%2C%20I%20took%20my%20dad%20to%20see%20a%20neurologist.%20We'd%20noticed%20a%20slight%20tremor%20in%20his%20right%20hand%20that%20came%20and%20went%2C%20and%20we%20wanted%20to%20get%20it%20checked%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20waited%20outside%20while%20Dad%20went%20in.%20When%20he%20emerged%2C%20he%20smiled.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20good%20news%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20assumed%20that%20meant%20he'd%20been%20given%20the%20all%20clear.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcaring-for-mom-with-parkinsons-at-home-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehave%20Parkinson's%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20clarified.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20stood%20there%2C%20dumfounded%2C%20then%20burst%20into%20tears%2C%20crying%20like%20a%20little%20girl%2C%20despite%20being%2041.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BHow%20is%20that%20good%20news%2C%20Dad%3F%26quot%3B%20I%20asked.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20dad%20is%20one%20of%20my%20favorite%20people%20in%20the%20world%2C%20and%20one%20of%20the%20things%20I%20admire%20most%20about%20him%20is%20his%20optimism.%20He's%20a%20glass-half-full%20person%20in%20every%20sense.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWell%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20%26quot%3Bit's%20the%20lesser%20of%20two%20evils.%20It's%20better%20than%20Alzheimer's.%26quot%3B%20That's%20one%20disease%20Dad%20has%20always%20feared.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2203a0bcbd-1a22-45b6-ab7f-8920dd68d4de%5C%22%3EI've%20felt%20both%20grief%20and%20gratitude%20since%20that%20day%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20way%20home%2C%20we%20stopped%20at%20a%20caf%C3%A9%2C%20and%20I%20bought%20him%20breakfast.%20As%20I%20looked%20across%20the%20table%20at%20this%20beautiful%20man%20who%20had%20always%20seemed%20invincible%20in%20my%20eyes%2C%20my%20heart%20broke.%20How%20could%20he%20have%20Parkinson's%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20as%20the%20days%20passed%20and%20we%20began%20to%20process%20the%20diagnosis%2C%20another%20emotion%20slowly%20emerged%20alongside%20the%20grief.%20Gratitude.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20so%20grateful%20to%20be%20home.%20Grateful%20to%20my%20husband%20for%20agreeing%20to%20uproot%20our%20lives%20in%20order%20to%20give%20me%20more%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Funspoken-rules-multigenerational-house-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etime%20with%20my%20parents%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Grateful%20to%20my%20kids%20for%20coming%20along%20for%20the%20ride.%20And%20grateful%20to%20my%20parents%20for%20welcoming%20us%20into%20their%20house.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMaybe%20it's%20a%20coincidence%20that%20I%20felt%20that%20unmistakable%20pull%20to%20come%20home.%20Maybe%20it's%20intuition.%20Either%20way%2C%20I%20know%20I'm%20exactly%20where%20I%20need%20to%20be%20at%20this%20point%20in%20my%20life.%20By%20my%20Dad's%20side%2C%20ready%20to%20support%20him%20on%20the%20road%20ahead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-in-parents-dads-diagnosis-confirmed-decision-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786188781000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a70aed2a62e6e00bc539c66%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-in-parents-dads-diagnosis-confirmed-decision-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22My%20family%20moved%20in%20with%20my%20parents%20because%20I%20wanted%20more%20time%20with%20them.%20When%20my%20dad%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20Parkinson's%2C%20I%20knew%20it%20was%20the%20right%20call.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Melissa%20Noble)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22BEML%20Q1%20results%3A%20Loss%20narrows%20to%20%E2%82%B927.01%20cr%2C%20order%20inflow%20rises%20to%20%E2%82%B91%2C181%20cr%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786188541000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2019-07%2F15%2Fthumb%2Ffitandfill%2F1200X628%2F1563202220-5565.PNG%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Fcompanies%2Fquarterly-results%2Fbeml-q1-results-loss-narrows-to-27-01-cr-order-inflow-rises-to-1-181-cr-126080800748_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22State-owned%20BEML%20has%20narrowed%20its%20consolidated%20net%20loss%20to%20Rs%2027.01%20crore%20in%20June%20quarter%20FY27%2C%20helped%20by%20increased%20revenues.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A92%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Fcompanies%2Fquarterly-results%2Fbeml-q1-results-loss-narrows-to-27-01-cr-order-inflow-rises-to-1-181-cr-126080800748_1.html%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-business--standard-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Fcompanies%2Fquarterly-results%2Fbeml-q1-results-loss-narrows-to-27-01-cr-order-inflow-rises-to-1-181-cr-126080800748_1.html%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Fcompanies%2Fquarterly-results%2Fbeml-q1-results-loss-narrows-to-27-01-cr-order-inflow-rises-to-1-181-cr-126080800748_1.html%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Norwegian%20soldiers%20say%20they're%20training%20Ukrainian%20soldiers%20with%20a%20'Viking%20mentality'%20built%20for%20harsh%20conditions%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Camouflaged%20military%20personnel%20train%20with%20belt-fed%20machine%20guns%20while%20an%20instructor%20points%20across%20a%20rugged%20outdoor%20range.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a75db268fcc2e955f7de3ef%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221498%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ENorway's%20soldiers%20want%20to%20give%20their%20Ukrainian%20counterparts%20a%20%26quot%3BViking%20mentality%26quot%3B%20as%20they%20lead%20training%20for%20them%20in%20Poland.%3Cp%3ENATO%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ENorwegian%20troops%20are%20bringing%20a%20Viking-inspired%20warrior%20culture%20into%20their%20training%20of%20Ukrainian%20soldiers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Telemark%20Battalion%20uses%20harsh%20training%20to%20build%20cohesion%2C%20discipline%2C%20and%20resilience.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EUkraine%20is%20also%20shaping%20the%20program%20and%20sharing%20its%20battlefield%20expertise%20with%20NATO.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ENorwegian%20soldiers%20are%20bringing%20their%20own%20%26quot%3BViking%20mentality%26quot%3B%20and%20warrior%20culture%20to%20the%20training%20of%20Ukrainian%20troops%20for%20war%20with%20Russia.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENorway%20is%20leading%20Operation%20Legio%2C%20a%20new%20international%20effort%20to%20support%2C%20train%2C%20and%20equip%20Ukrainian%20soldiers%20for%20the%20fight.%20Battlefield%20training%20combines%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-ukraine-soldiers-trained-uk-soldiers-havent-seen-real-war-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUkrainian%20combat%20experience%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20NATO%20warfighting%20practices.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20training%2C%20supported%20by%2011%20nations%2C%20is%20primarily%20conducted%20by%20personnel%20from%20the%20Telemark%20Battalion%2C%20an%20elite%20mechanized%20infantry%20battalion%20of%20the%20Norwegian%20Army%20that%20has%20made%20aspects%20of%20Viking%20culture%20central%20to%20its%20identity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMaj.%20John%2C%20the%20S3%20Operations%20Officer%20in%20charge%20of%20synchronizing%20the%20overall%20training%20operation%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20Norway's%20Telemark%20Battalion%20puts%20great%20emphasis%20on%20building%20skills%2C%20but%20also%20developing%20a%20%26quot%3Bwarrior%20mentality%26quot%3B%20that%20allows%20them%20to%20fight%20and%20%26quot%3Bthrive%20in%20harsh%20conditions.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20draw%20that%20warrior%20mentality%20from%20our%20Viking%20heritage%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20%26quot%3Band%20the%20Viking%20culture%20is%20very%20important%20for%20us.%26quot%3B%20He%20asked%20to%20only%20be%20identified%20by%20his%20first%20name%20for%20security%20reasons.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20elite%20battalion%2C%20which%20has%20deployed%20on%20combat%20missions%20in%20places%20like%20the%20Balkans%2C%20Afghanistan%2C%20and%20Iraq%2C%20is%20represented%20by%20the%20emblem%20of%20a%20Viking%20ship%2C%20and%20the%20unit's%20Viking-inspired%20battle%20cry%20is%3A%20%26quot%3BTo%20Valhalla!%26quot%3B%20In%20Norse%20mythology%2C%20Valhalla%20is%20the%20great%20hall%20in%20Asgard%20for%20brave%20warriors%20slain%20in%20battle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJohn%20said%20the%20battalion's%20mindset%20is%20%26quot%3Bnot%20like%20over-aggressive%2C%20over-eager%2C%20doing%20stupid%20stuff.%20We%20take%20the%20best%20parts%20of%20that%20Viking%20mentality%20and%20then%20apply%20it%20to%20the%20ethical%20and%20moral%20standards%20that%20are%20required%20of%20our%20soldiers.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226240%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Uniformed%20soldiers%20carrying%20rifles%20stand%20in%20formation%20in%20front%20of%20armored%20vehicles%20and%20tank%20guns%20outdoors.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a747ddc0c6c5a263f3a6ed0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224160%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20insignia%20of%20the%20Telemark%20Battalion%2C%20visible%20in%20the%20green%20background%20flag%2C%20is%20a%20Viking%20ship.%3Cp%3ESean%20Gallup%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EJohn%20said%20the%20training%20emphasizes%20both%20battlefield%20skills%20and%20the%20%26quot%3Bwarrior%20mentality%26quot%3B%20and%20discipline%20needed%20to%20%26quot%3Bthrive%20in%20harsh%20conditions.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20a%20mix%20between%20skills%20and%20mentality%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Ukrainians%20arriving%20for%20training%20are%20not%20necessarily%20novices%20when%20it%20comes%20to%20enduring%20harsh%20conditions.%20Many%20of%20them%20come%20from%20a%20military%20shaped%20by%20years%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-soldiers-coordinate-every-step-reach-zero-line-russia-drones-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehigh-intensity%20warfare%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20Norwegian%20leaders%20repeatedly%20described%20the%20training%20as%20an%20exchange%20in%20which%20Ukraine's%20combat%20experience%20shapes%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-sharing-weapons-and-battle-expertise-with-west-tables-turned-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ewhat%20its%20NATO%20partners%20teach%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20way%20the%20Norwegians%20reinforce%20their%20approach%2C%20John%20said%2C%20is%20%26quot%3Bthrough%20exposing%20them%20to%20harsh%20training.%26quot%3B%20The%20training%2C%20conducted%20at%20a%20camp%20in%20southeastern%20Poland%2C%20is%20designed%20to%20be%20tough%2C%20with%20daytime%20and%20nighttime%20operations%20and%20scenarios%20intended%20to%20replicate%20battlefield%20conditions%20as%20closely%20as%20possible.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBrigadier%20Atle%20Molde%2C%20commander%20of%20Task%20Force%20Legio%2C%20doesn't%20currently%20serve%20in%20the%20Telemark%20battalion%2C%20but%20he%20said%20of%20this%20unit%20that%20%26quot%3Bthey%20have%20their%20culture%2C%20and%20of%20course%2C%20a%20warrior%20mentality%20is%20a%20good%20thing%20as%20long%20as%20it%20drives%20unit%20cohesion%20and%20fighting%20for%20something%20common.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20the%20training%20camp%2C%20a%20purpose-built%20training%20site%20in%20Poland%2C%20roughly%20two%20hours%20from%20Ukraine's%20border%2C%20reflects%20that%20Viking%20identity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECamp%20Jomsborg%20was%20established%20in%202025%2C%20and%20it%20began%20its%20fifth%2051-day%20rotation%20of%20Ukrainian%20soldiers%20in%20late%20May.%20Norway%20acts%20as%20the%20framework%20nation%2C%20providing%20the%20main%20structure%20and%20leadership%20for%20the%20other%20participating%20countries.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20all%20about%20the%20Ukrainian%20soldier%20and%20increasing%20his%20lethality%20and%20survivability%20within%20this%20program%20before%20he%20leaves%20for%20front-line%20war%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20John.%20The%20main%20goal%2C%20he%20said%2C%20is%20supporting%20Ukraine%20so%20it%20can%20keep%20defending%20itself%20and%20win%20the%20war%20on%20its%20own%20or%20negotiate%20a%20peace%20agreement%20on%20its%20own%20terms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20name%20Camp%20Jomsborg%20comes%20from%20the%20legendary%20Viking%20fortress%20Jomsborg.%20Molde%20said%20that%20what%20characterized%20the%20Jomsvikings%2C%20a%20legendary%20warrior%20brotherhood%20based%20along%20the%20Baltic%20Sea%2C%20%26quot%3Bwas%20that%20they%20were%20very%20disciplined%20and%20professional%20warriors.%20So%20that's%20where%20the%20name%20comes%20from.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20history%20is%20visible%20throughout%20the%20camp%2C%20which%20Business%20Insider%20visited.%20Viking-inspired%20signs%20and%20a%20large%20Viking%20ship%20decorate%20the%20huge%2C%20purpose-built%20site%20where%20soldiers%20train%2C%20eat%2C%20and%20sleep.%20There%20are%20other%20references%20to%20Norwegian%20culture%2C%20too%2C%20with%20its%20streets%20named%20after%20figures%20like%20Thor%2C%20the%20Norse%20god%20of%20thunder.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Wooden%20CAMP%20JOMSBORG%20entrance%20sign%20with%20a%20Viking%20head%20emblem%20stands%20between%20two%20flagpoles%20near%20a%20forest.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a746d7c0c0bf4e8be52212f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Camp%20Jomsborg%20training%20site%20has%20Viking-inspired%20decoration.%3Cp%3ESin%C3%A9ad%20Baker%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMolde%20said%20that%20%26quot%3Bunit%20cohesion%20is%20important%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20that%20the%20Telemark%20Battalion%20was%20seeking%20to%20take%20what%20it%20sees%20as%20positive%20in%20its%20own%20culture%20and%20%26quot%3Btry%20to%20give%20that%20over%20to%20the%20Ukrainians%20as%20well.%20So%20long%20as%20it%20has%20a%20positive%20effect%2C%20it's%20a%20good%20thing.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPlus%2C%20he%20said%2C%20%26quot%3Bfor%20one%20reason%20or%20another%2C%20the%20whole%20Viking%20mythology%2C%20the%20Ukrainians%20like%20that.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUkraine's%20military%20and%20civilian%20population%20have%20shown%20extraordinary%20resilience%20under%20years%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frussian-attack-ukrainian-city-dnipro-residents-rebuilding-with-plywood-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esustained%20Russian%20attacks%