n%20requests%20and%20expertise%20and%20is%20regularly%20updated%20based%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnato-wants-same-battlefield-feedback-loop-ukraine-mastered-top-general-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUkrainian%20feedback%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDefining%20it%20that%20way%20means%20Ukraine%20can%20%26quot%3Bhold%20us%20accountable%20for%20quality%20and%20delivering%20that%20realistic%20training%2C%26quot%3B%20John%20said.%20That%20cooperation%2C%20he%20said%2C%20%26quot%3Bis%20what%20has%20made%20this%20an%20effective%20training%20mission.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMany%20of%20the%20Ukrainians%20at%20Camp%20Jomsborg%20have%20real-world%20lessons%20from%20brutal%20warfare%20that%20their%20instructors%20lack%2C%20while%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-ukraine-soldiers-trained-uk-soldiers-havent-seen-real-war-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EWestern%20trainers%3C%2Fa%3E%20have%20decades%20of%20institutional%20experience%20and%20NATO%20practices%20to%20offer%20in%20return.%20Molde%20said%20it's%20a%20case%20of%20everyone%20working%20together%20to%20combine%20those%20strengths%20and%20learn%20from%20one%20another.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJ%C3%B8rgen%2C%20a%20Norwegian%20instructor%20at%20the%20camp%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20training%20the%20Ukrainians%20isn't%20difficult.%20%26quot%3BI%20think%20it's%20quite%20incredible%20how%20eager%20to%20learn%20they%20are%20in%20general%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BIt%20kind%20of%20confirms%20how%20good%20the%20guys%20are.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnorway-soldiers-training-ukraine-troops-viking-mentality-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1786188001000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a75db268fcc2e955f7de3ef%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bus